=================================================
ROPE MODULE LIBRARY REFACTOR PLAN
=================================================

Goals
-------------------------------------------------

- Move all module definitions into self-contained packages.
- Remove modules.py as the source of truth.
- Support lazy module loading.
- Support validation-driven library management.
- Remove variant mutation/reset logic.
- Clearly separate standard and nonstandard modules.
- Make library_index the validated library manifest.


=================================================
